<title>USA: Crawford &amp; Co sets qtly dividends.</title>
<headline>Crawford &amp; Co sets qtly dividends.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crawford &amp; Co said it declared a quarterly dividend of $0.11 per share on its class A and class B common stocks.</p>
<p>The dividends are payable on May 15 to shareholders of record on May 6.</p>
<p>The prior dividends of $0.165 per share were the same as the latest dividend after the effect of a three-for-two stock split.</p>
</text>
